WEBVTT

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.518
I would write down many of these lessons
in my memoir, "How to Be Black,"

00:02:01.542 --> 00:02:04.809
which if you haven't read yet,
makes you a racist, because --

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:06.059
(Laughter)

00:02:06.083 --> 00:02:08.208
you've had plenty of time
to read the book.

00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:14.268
But America insists on reminding me

00:02:14.292 --> 00:02:15.726
and teaching me

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.893
what it means to be black in America.

00:02:18.917 --> 00:02:20.893
It's December 2018,

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:24.643
I'm with my fiancé
in the suburbs of Wisconsin.

00:02:24.667 --> 00:02:27.768
We are visiting her parents,
both of whom are white,

00:02:27.792 --> 00:02:29.059
which makes her white.

00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:31.184
That's how it works.
I don't make the rules.